error: `this.out` is written into itself
  `this.out` may move to a larger block while it grows, and what is written would be read from the old one
  --> error_write_field_into_itself.sg:4:24
 4 |         this.out.write(this.out)
   |                        ^^^^^^^^
  hint: copy it first: `var copy = this.out.clone()`
